'''Halloween'''

# The [[eve]] of [[All Hallows' Day]]; 31st [[October]]; celebrated (mostly in the [[United States]], [[Canada]], [[United Kingdom]] and [[Ireland]],) by [[children]] going [[door-to-door]] in [[costume]] and demanding [[candy]] with [[menace]]s.

